-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ה/2 (4.8.2024): פתיחת תיקי גננות ודיווח משרות; העסקת עובדי הוראה, עובדי בעלות, בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד המוכרים שאינם רשמיים, בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש בשנה"ל תשפ"ה
-- For the owners of special-education kindergartens in recognised
-- unofficial education not yet in Ofek Hadash: part א, opening the
-- teachers' online files and reporting their positions (the basis of the
-- kindergarten's profile budget); part ב, joining Ofek Hadash in תשפ"ה —
-- the commitment letter, who joins, the work week, part-time and
-- over-100% employment, mothers' and age hours, seniority, promotion, role
-- rewards, grade determination and the salary advance until it.
--
-- Corpus notes: the corpus nests much of part ב one level off (2.1.1(2)-(4)
-- inside (1); the headings of sections 3 to 17 inside the paragraph before
-- each; 11.1-11.2.3 as paragraphs of 10.2; the sign-off and the undertaking
-- inside 17.3); 4.1.1's table is split between a table and loose rows; and
-- annex ה's table is flattened into lines whose serial column is garbled
-- (each row carries the next serial's digit). The rows are read here by
-- their printed content.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in days from the circular
-- (4.8.2024 = day 0): 30.8.2024 is day 26 and 31.12.2024 day 149, unless a
-- rule says otherwise.

§ `תשפ"ה/2 גני ילדים לחינוך מיוחד במוכר שאינו רשמי`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 The letterhead, date (4.8.2024), reference number, circular number, addressee (owners of special-education kindergartens in recognised unofficial education not yet in Ofek Hadash), greeting, the two subjects and the statement that the circular covers them; no rule.

DECLARE `kindergarten action` IS ONE OF
    `report the teachers' employment` HAS `teachers reported` IS A NUMBER
    `appoint a reporting officer` HAS `officers appointed` IS A NUMBER
    `instruct the teachers to open online files` HAS `teachers instructed` IS A NUMBER
    `approve the file and certify the documents` HAS `files approved` IS A NUMBER
    `instruct existing teachers to check their data` HAS `existing teachers instructed` IS A NUMBER
    `obtain employment approvals` HAS `approvals obtained` IS A NUMBER
    `send the commitment letter` HAS `kindergartens covered` IS A NUMBER
    `submit an exceptions request` HAS `exception requests` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay by the grade and deduct the advances` HAS `retroactive pay` IS A NUMBER
    `transfer the salary interface` HAS `months transferred` IS A NUMBER
    `allow the mother's absence` HAS `days of absence` IS A NUMBER
    `pay for kindergarten activity hours` HAS `activity hours paid` IS A NUMBER
    `employ above 42 weekly hours` HAS `weekly hours employed` IS A NUMBER

-- akn:art_a The heading of part א, "reporting for the kindergarten profile (opening files and reporting positions)".
-- akn:art_b The heading of part ב, "employing teaching staff ... under the Ofek Hadash reform in תשפ"ה — instructions to owners who seek to join".

§§ `א. דיווח מצבת עובדי ההוראה`

-- akn:art_b__para_a The heading "א. reporting the teaching staff of recognised unofficial special-education kindergartens".

-- p2: since תש"פא every teaching employee in such a kindergarten opens an
-- online file with the Ministry, and the owning body reports the
-- employment to the Ministry every year.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a/p2
GIVEN `teachers employed this year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body reports its teachers yearly` `teachers employed this year` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `report the teachers' employment` n
          PROVIDED n EQUALS `teachers employed this year`
    WITHIN 365

-- akn:art_b__para_a/p3 akn:art_b__para_a/p4 akn:art_b__para_a/p5 Background: why the reporting exists — the Ministry, as regulator, sets education, qualification and seniority, grants permits and checks criminal records, and budgets the kindergartens by their staff (the profile); no rule.
-- akn:art_b__para_a/p6 akn:art_b__para_a/p7 An exhortation to follow the instructions below, and the lead-in "the actions required of the owning body"; no rule.

-- Stage א: the owning body appoints one reporting officer only — its own
-- employee (in an employer-employee relationship, not a service provider),
-- preferably from human resources — given the role "reporting officer"; an
-- owner without one sends the permission form by e-mail; the Ministry
-- checks it and grants a personal permission that may not be passed on; a
-- change needs a written request; no more than one is approved.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p5 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p6 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p7 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p8
GIVEN `is the owner's employee` IS A BOOLEAN, `officers already approved` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reporting officer may be approved` `is the owner's employee` `officers already approved` IF
    `is the owner's employee` AND `officers already approved` EQUALS 0

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body appoints one reporting officer` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `appoint a reporting officer` n
          PROVIDED n EQUALS 1

-- Stage ב: every year the owning body instructs its teachers
-- (kindergarten teachers and health-profession teachers), new ones and
-- those with no file, to open an online file in the teachers' portal; the
-- teacher fills a questionnaire with personal details, education, a
-- placement request, declarations and documents.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2__cls_a akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2__cls_b
GIVEN `teachers without a file` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body instructs teachers to open files` `teachers without a file` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `instruct the teachers to open online files` n
          PROVIDED n AT LEAST `teachers without a file`
    WITHIN 365

-- ג-ד: the reporting officer approves the file, certifies the documents as
-- true copies and enters the institution code (the cluster's, for a
-- teacher in a kindergarten cluster). The file opens in three stages: the
-- teacher's questionnaire, the owner's approval and placement report, the
-- Ministry's grade, seniority and approval.
@ref akn:art_c akn:art_d/p1 akn:art_d/p2 akn:art_d/p3 akn:art_d/p4 akn:art_d/p5
GIVEN `teacher submitted the questionnaire` IS A BOOLEAN, `owner approved and reported placement` IS A BOOLEAN, `the Ministry approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the file is open` `teacher submitted the questionnaire` `owner approved and reported placement` `the Ministry approved` IF
    `teacher submitted the questionnaire` AND `owner approved and reported placement` AND `the Ministry approved`

GIVEN `works in a kindergarten cluster` IS A BOOLEAN, `kindergarten code` IS A STRING, `cluster code` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the institution code to report` `works in a kindergarten cluster` `kindergarten code` `cluster code` IS
    IF `works in a kindergarten cluster` THEN `cluster code` ELSE `kindergarten code`

-- akn:art_e Guidance for the teachers is published in the teachers' portal and a user guide; no rule.

-- ו: the owning body instructs its existing teachers to check through the
-- portal that the Ministry's education and seniority data are current;
-- further data are updated through the district, by one of three ways
-- (originals in person, originals by post, or certified copies sent by the
-- reporting officer by e-mail).
@ref akn:art_f akn:art_f/p2 akn:art_f/p3 akn:art_f/p4
GIVEN `existing teachers` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body has existing teachers check their data` `existing teachers` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `instruct existing teachers to check their data` n
          PROVIDED n AT LEAST `existing teachers`

DECLARE `way to update data` IS ONE OF
    `originals in person at the district`
    `originals by post to the district`
    `certified copies e-mailed by the reporting officer`

-- p5: which district an institution belongs to is in the owners' portal;
-- the districts' contacts and hours are "in annex ח" (F-2024-25_tashpah_02-f).
@ref akn:art_f/p5
`the annex the districts' contacts are said to be in` MEANS "ח"
`the annexes the circular has` MEANS LIST "א", "ב", "ג", "ד", "ה", "ו"

-- akn:art_f/p6 akn:art_f/p7 A pointer to the portal's guidance on opening a file, with its link; no rule.

-- Stage ג: the owning body obtains an employment approval for every
-- teacher it employs, under the procedure for תשפ"ה at the link.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3/p1 akn:art_f__para_3/p2
GIVEN `teachers employed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body obtains employment approvals` `teachers employed` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `obtain employment approvals` n
          PROVIDED n EQUALS `teachers employed`

-- Stage ד: every teacher in the kindergartens is placed in the reporting
-- systems — those who meet the joining conditions, under the reform, and
-- those who do not, under pre-reform terms; the duty binds every owner,
-- whether or not it joined Ofek Hadash in תשפ"א-תשפ"ה.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3/p3 akn:art_f__para_3/p4 akn:art_f__para_3/p5
GIVEN `joined Ofek Hadash` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `must report every teacher's position` `joined Ofek Hadash` IF
    `joined Ofek Hadash` OR NOT `joined Ofek Hadash`

-- Stage ה: after the earlier stages, the owner's profile is computed in
-- OSHER from its teachers' attributes and its employment reports.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4/p1
GIVEN `files opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `approvals obtained` IS A BOOLEAN, `positions reported` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the profile can be computed` `files opened` `approvals obtained` `positions reported` IF
    `files opened` AND `approvals obtained` AND `positions reported`

§§ `ב. העסקת עובדי הוראה בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש`

-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b The heading of part ב (printed again).
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1 The heading "1. introduction".
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p5 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p6 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p7 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p8 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p9 Background: the State's notice in HCJ 6677/19, the inter-ministerial team and its report, Ofek Hadash applied to these kindergartens since תשפ"א, and regulation 3(6) of the recognised-institutions regulations (2022) as amended, quoted; no rule of its own.

-- p10: every special-education kindergarten not yet in Ofek Hadash joins,
-- under the regulations, from תשפ"ה.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p10
GIVEN `school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the Hebrew year, תשפ"ה = 5785
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the kindergarten is in Ofek Hadash in` `school year` IF
    `school year` AT LEAST 5785

-- p11: the Ministry alone approves a teacher's joining, sets the Ofek
-- Hadash grade and converts the salary; it also sets education and
-- seniority.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p11
GIVEN p IS A Party
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may approve joining and set the grade` p IF
    p EQUALS `the Ministry of Education`

-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p12 The chapter's purpose; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_2 The heading "2. areas of responsibility".
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1 The heading "2.1 stage one".
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1 The heading "2.1.1 actions of the owning body".

-- 2.1.1(1): until the regulations are amended, an owning body that joins
-- in תשפ"ה signs a commitment to apply Ofek Hadash to its kindergartens and
-- e-mails it to the Ministry by 30.8.2024 (day 26); annexes א and ב are
-- kept by the owner, not sent; after that day the institution cannot join
-- in תשפ"ה.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p5 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p6 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p7
GIVEN `special-education kindergartens owned` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the commitment letter is sent by 30.8.2024` `special-education kindergartens owned` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `send the commitment letter` n
          PROVIDED n EQUALS `special-education kindergartens owned`
    WITHIN 26

GIVEN `day the letter was sent` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the institution can join in תשפ"ה` `day the letter was sent` IF
    `day the letter was sent` AT MOST 26

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_02-l: 2.1.1(1) has the owner undertake to apply Ofek
-- Hadash "על בתי הספר לחינוך מיוחד שבבעלותה" — its special-education
-- SCHOOLS — while the undertaking it attaches names "כל גני הילדים לחינוך
-- מיוחד שבבעלותי". The reading adopted: the kindergartens, as the form and
-- the circular's subject say (the rule above counts kindergartens).
DECLARE `kind of institution` IS ONE OF
    `special-education school`
    `special-education kindergarten`

`what 2.1.1(1) has the owner undertake for` MEANS `special-education school`
`what the undertaking itself names` MEANS `special-education kindergarten`

`2.1.1(1) and the undertaking name different institutions` MEANS
    NOT `what 2.1.1(1) has the owner undertake for` EQUALS `what the undertaking itself names`
#ASSERT `2.1.1(1) and the undertaking name different institutions`

-- 2.1.1(2)-(4), printed inside (1): open the files (part א), find the
-- teachers who meet the joining conditions (section 3), and report the
-- positions of all of them, whether they meet the conditions or not.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p9 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p10 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p11 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p12
GIVEN `teachers in the kindergartens` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body reports every teacher's position` `teachers in the kindergartens` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `report the teachers' employment` n
          PROVIDED n EQUALS `teachers in the kindergartens`

-- 2.1.1(5): teachers who meet the joining conditions work the Ofek Hadash
-- week and are paid Ofek Hadash terms — until their grade is set, the Ofek
-- Hadash advance, which the clause places in "section 12 below" (it is in
-- section 17; F-2024-25_tashpah_02-c).
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5
GIVEN `meets the joining conditions` IS A BOOLEAN, `grade is set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `paid by` `meets the joining conditions` `grade is set` IS
    IF `meets the joining conditions`
    THEN (IF `grade is set`
          THEN "Ofek Hadash terms by the grade"
          ELSE "current terms with the Ofek Hadash advance")
    ELSE "pre-reform terms"

`the section the advance is said to be in` MEANS 12
`the section the advance is in` MEANS 17

-- 2.1.1(6)-(7): the school day is adjusted to the Ofek Hadash closing hour
-- (section 4.1.4) and the teachers' timetable to the Ofek Hadash week.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_6 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_7
GIVEN `the day ends at the Ofek Hadash closing hour` IS A BOOLEAN, `the timetable follows the Ofek Hadash week` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the kindergarten runs on Ofek Hadash hours` `the day ends at the Ofek Hadash closing hour` `the timetable follows the Ofek Hadash week` IF
    `the day ends at the Ofek Hadash closing hour` AND `the timetable follows the Ofek Hadash week`

-- 2.1.1(8): the owning body transfers to Unique (the Ministry's
-- contractor) an interface of the salary paid in the month asked for, by
-- the Ministry's structure; the Ministry then sets the grade and converts.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body transfers the salary interface` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `transfer the salary interface` n
          PROVIDED n AT LEAST 1

-- 2.1.1(9): once the grade is set and reported through Unique, the owning
-- body pays by the grade from the joining date and deducts the advances
-- ("section 12 below", again section 17).
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_9
GIVEN `Ofek Hadash pay from joining` IS A NUMBER, `paid meanwhile, advances included` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the retroactive balance` `Ofek Hadash pay from joining` `paid meanwhile, advances included` IS
    `Ofek Hadash pay from joining` MINUS `paid meanwhile, advances included`

GIVEN `Ofek Hadash pay from joining` IS A NUMBER, `paid meanwhile, advances included` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body pays by the grade` `Ofek Hadash pay from joining` `paid meanwhile, advances included` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay by the grade and deduct the advances` x
          PROVIDED x EQUALS `the retroactive balance` `Ofek Hadash pay from joining` `paid meanwhile, advances included`

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2 The heading "2.1.2 actions of the Ministry".

-- 2.1.2: the Ministry approves joining for owners who signed in time and
-- as required; handles exceptional joining (3.2.1) and requests not to join
-- (3.6); after the files and reports, checks each teacher's conditions and
-- decides the joining; sets the grade; computes the profile; reimburses
-- the owner for the teachers employed under Ofek Hadash and deducts the
-- advances paid.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_a akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_b akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_c
GIVEN `signed in time and as required` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry approves the owner's joining` `signed in time and as required` IF
    `signed in time and as required`

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_c__pnt_3 The heading "3. joining conditions".
-- akn:art_f__para_3-1 The heading "3.1 definitions".

§§ `3. תנאי ההצטרפות`

@desc A teaching employee of a special-education kindergarten, as section 3 asks about one.
DECLARE `kindergarten teacher` HAS
    `recognised teaching seniority`       IS A NUMBER  @desc years of seniority for actual teaching (0 for a new teacher)
    `is academic`                         IS A BOOLEAN @desc an academic degree recognised here or abroad, or an equivalent salary grade the Ministry approved (3.1.3)
    `is certified to teach`               IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teaching certificate or other qualification by the Ministry's rules (3.1.4)
    `position`                            IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held
    `approved as an exception`            IS A BOOLEAN

-- 3.1.1-3.1.2: a new teacher has no recognised years of actual teaching
-- (internship, army or national service in teaching do not count here); an
-- existing teacher is entitled to such years for salary.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-1 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-2 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-3 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-4
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an existing teacher` t IF
    t's `recognised teaching seniority` GREATER THAN 0

-- akn:art_f__para_3-2 The heading "3.2 joining conditions of existing teachers".

-- 3.2.1: an existing academic joins if certified to teach and employed at
-- a third of a position or more; one without certification may ask the
-- exceptions committee, through the owner, on the annex ג form, by e-mail,
-- by 31.12.2024 (day 149).
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p7
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing academic joins` t IF
        `is an existing teacher` t
    AND t's `is academic`
    AND (t's `is certified to teach` OR t's `approved as an exception`)
    AND t's `position` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

`the last day for exceptional-joining requests by 3.2.1` MEANS 149

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `an exceptional-joining request` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `submit an exceptions request` n
          PROVIDED n AT LEAST 1
    WITHIN `the last day for exceptional-joining requests by 3.2.1`

-- 3.2.1, last paragraph: an uncertified teacher with under 25 years cannot
-- advance in grade until certified; the work and part of the studies count
-- for promotion "as in section 12.2.2" (it is 11.2.2; F-2024-25_tashpah_02-d).
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p8 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p9
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may advance in grade under 3.2.1` t IF
    t's `is certified to teach` OR t's `recognised teaching seniority` AT LEAST 25

`the section 3.2.1 sends promotion to` MEANS "12.2.2"
`the section promotion of the uncertified is in` MEANS "11.2.2"

-- akn:art_f__para_3-3 The heading "3.3 existing teachers who are not academic".

-- 3.3.1: a non-academic with 28 years or more is employed under the reform
-- in any case.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a non-academic veteran joins` t IF
    `is an existing teacher` t AND (NOT t's `is academic`) AND t's `recognised teaching seniority` AT LEAST 28

-- akn:art_f__para_3-4 The heading "3.4 joining conditions of new teachers".

DECLARE `degree` IS ONE OF `first degree`, `second degree`, `doctorate`

-- 3.4.1: a new academic in a joined kindergarten is placed at grade 1,
-- seniority 1, in the table of the degree held; a doctorate in the
-- second-degree table, with 5% of the combined salary on top.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p6
GIVEN d IS A `degree`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the salary table of a new academic` d IS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `first degree` THEN "first degree"
    OTHERWISE "second degree"

GIVEN d IS A `degree`, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the doctorate supplement` d `combined salary` IS
    IF d EQUALS `doctorate` THEN 0.05 TIMES `combined salary` ELSE 0

`a new academic's starting grade` MEANS 1
`a new academic's starting seniority` MEANS 1

-- 3.4.2: a new non-academic teacher not entitled to intern pay under
-- 145-148 of the agreement is placed by education (senior, qualified or
-- unqualified).
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-2
DECLARE `non-academic education` IS ONE OF `senior`, `qualified`, `unqualified`

GIVEN e IS A `non-academic education`
GIVETH A `non-academic education`
DECIDE `the salary table of a new non-academic` e IS e

-- akn:art_f__para_3-5 The heading "3.5 interns".

-- 3.5.1-3.5.3: in a joined kindergarten interns work only under the
-- reform; the year counts only at a third of a position or more for six
-- months at least (July-August excluded); at most two school years, in
-- which a degree and certificate are completed, or the intern cannot
-- continue under the reform; the internship counts for tenure, jubilee
-- and recuperation seniority, not for salary seniority or the minimum time
-- for promotion.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-1 akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-2 akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-3
GIVEN `position held` IS A NUMBER, `months worked September to June` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship year counts` `position held` `months worked September to June` IF
    `position held` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 AND `months worked September to June` AT LEAST 6

GIVEN `years of internship` IS A NUMBER, `completed degree and certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the intern may continue under the reform` `years of internship` `completed degree and certificate` IF
    `years of internship` AT MOST 2 OR `completed degree and certificate`

DECLARE `kind of seniority` IS ONE OF `salary seniority`, `minimum time for promotion`, `tenure`, `jubilee grant`, `recuperation`

GIVEN k IS A `kind of seniority`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship counts for` k IF
    NOT (k EQUALS `salary seniority` OR k EQUALS `minimum time for promotion`)

-- akn:art_f__para_3-6 The heading "3.6 leaving Ofek Hadash".

-- 3.6: every teacher who meets the conditions must join; exceptionally, a
-- request not to join may be heard on health (the teacher's or a
-- first-degree relative's, with current certificates) or on an adverse
-- personal change after joining, on the annex ד form, through the owner by
-- e-mail, by 31.12.2024 (day 149).
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-1 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-3 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-4 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-5
DECLARE `ground for not joining` IS ONE OF
    `health of the teacher or a first-degree relative`
    `adverse personal change after joining`
    `no recognised ground`

GIVEN g IS A `ground for not joining`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a request not to join may be heard` g IF
    NOT g EQUALS `no recognised ground`

`the last day for requests not to join by 3.6.5` MEANS 149

-- 3.7: a substitute employed in weekly hours over time (not single
-- hours) takes the employment terms of the teacher replaced.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-7/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-7/p2
GIVEN `employed in weekly timetable hours` IS A BOOLEAN, `terms of the teacher replaced` IS A STRING, `own terms` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the substitute's terms` `employed in weekly timetable hours` `terms of the teacher replaced` `own terms` IS
    IF `employed in weekly timetable hours` THEN `terms of the teacher replaced` ELSE `own terms`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-7__subpara_4 The heading "4. the work week in special-education kindergartens in Ofek Hadash".
-- akn:art_f__para_4-1 The heading "4.1 the work week of kindergarten teachers (annex ה)".

§§ `4. מבנה שבוע העבודה`

DECLARE `kindergarten post` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten manager`
    `fellow kindergarten teacher`
    `cluster manager`

DECLARE `age band` IS ONE OF
    `under 50`
    `50 to 55, 55 excluded`
    `55 and over, new`
    `55 and over, existing`

-- 4.1.1's table: the position base by post and age (age hours, section 8;
-- new and existing, section 3.1); the "fellow" teacher is what the
-- 19.10.2022 agreement renamed the "completing" teacher from תשפ"ד.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/t1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p8
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
      `manager's` IS A NUMBER
      `fellow's` IS A NUMBER
      `cluster manager's` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `by post` p `manager's` `fellow's` `cluster manager's` IS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `kindergarten manager`        THEN `manager's`
    WHEN `fellow kindergarten teacher` THEN `fellow's`
    WHEN `cluster manager`             THEN `cluster manager's`

GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`, a IS AN `age band`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position base` p a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `under 50`               THEN `by post` p 30.4 33.8 34
    WHEN `50 to 55, 55 excluded`  THEN `by post` p 28.4 31.8 32
    WHEN `55 and over, new`       THEN `by post` p 28.4 31.8 32
    WHEN `55 and over, existing`  THEN `by post` p 26.4 29.8 30

-- The table's second note sends age hours to "section 7 below"; they are
-- section 8 (F-2024-25_tashpah_02-e).
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p7
`the section age hours are said to be in` MEANS 7
`the section age hours are in` MEANS 8

-- 4.1.2: the manager's and the fellow teacher's positions are all frontal
-- hours; a cluster manager's 34 hours split between frontal (or enrichment)
-- hours and management hours by the number of kindergartens.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/t1
DECLARE `cluster row` HAS
    `kindergartens in the cluster` IS A NUMBER
    `frontal or enrichment hours`  IS A NUMBER
    `management hours`             IS A NUMBER
    `cluster hours in all`         IS A NUMBER

`the cluster manager's table` MEANS
    LIST `cluster row` 4  22 12 34,
         `cluster row` 5  19 15 34,
         `cluster row` 6  16 18 34,
         `cluster row` 7  13 21 34,
         `cluster row` 8  10 24 34,
         `cluster row` 9  7  27 34,
         `cluster row` 10 4  30 34,
         `cluster row` 11 4  30 34

GIVEN k IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `cluster rows for` k IS
    count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `kindergartens in the cluster` EQUALS k) `the cluster manager's table`)

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_02-m: the table runs from 4 kindergartens to "10 or
-- 11"; section 14's cluster allowance ("עד 6 גנים", "7 גנים ומעלה") has no
-- floor or ceiling. A cluster of 3 or of 12 has no split of the 34 hours.
-- The reading adopted: the table as printed; outside 4-11 the split is
-- undecided and the 34-hour base still applies.
`the cluster-hours table has no row for 3 or 12 kindergartens` MEANS
        `cluster rows for` 3 EQUALS 0
    AND `cluster rows for` 12 EQUALS 0
    AND all (GIVEN k YIELD `cluster rows for` k EQUALS 1) (LIST 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11)
    AND `the cluster management rate` 3 EQUALS 0.25
    AND `the cluster management rate` 12 EQUALS 0.28
#ASSERT `the cluster-hours table has no row for 3 or 12 kindergartens`

-- 4.1.3: work starts at 7:55.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3
`work starts at` MEANS "7:55"

DECLARE `kind of special-education kindergarten` IS ONE OF
    `physical disability`
    `deaf and hard of hearing`
    `blind and visually impaired`
    `moderate intellectual disability`
    `moderate complex intellectual disability`
    `severe, profound or nursing intellectual disability`
    `autism`
    `severe mental disorders`
    `mild intellectual disability`
    `every other kind`

-- 4.1.4: the closing hour, Sunday-Thursday, by kind (Friday 12:45 for
-- all), as hours after midnight; a kindergarten that closed at 16:00 before
-- the reform keeps its day and the teacher adds forty minutes in overlap; a
-- day closing at 14:00 is 6.08 working hours, and others accordingly.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p9 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p10 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p11 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p12 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p13
GIVEN k IS A `kind of special-education kindergarten`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the Sunday-Thursday closing hour` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `autism` THEN "16:45"
    WHEN `severe mental disorders` THEN "16:00"
    WHEN `every other kind` THEN "14:00"
    OTHERWISE "15:10"

`the Friday closing hour` MEANS "12:45"

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p14 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p15 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p16 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p17
`working hours of a day closing at 14:00` MEANS 6.08
`minutes added in overlap where the day closed at 16:00` MEANS 40

-- 4.1.5: the position is the weekly hours worked over the position base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p3
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, base IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position` `weekly hours` base IS
    `weekly hours` DIVIDED BY base

-- 4.2: a health-profession teacher or arts therapist works 36 hours: 26
-- frontal, 3 individual (a group of up to 3, content set with the head of
-- the framework by the Ministry's guidance) and 7 stay hours in the
-- kindergarten (adapting the curriculum, parents, committees, aides,
-- outside coordination, continuity); the detailed table is at the link.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_a akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_b akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p9 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p10 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p11 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p12
`the health-profession week` MEANS 36
`health frontal hours` MEANS 26
`health individual hours` MEANS 3
`health stay hours` MEANS 7

-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c__cls_5 The heading "5. part-time employment under the reform".

§§ `5. העסקה בחלקיות משרה`

DECLARE `kind of teacher` IS ONE OF
    `existing kindergarten teacher`
    `new kindergarten teacher`
    `fellow kindergarten teacher in reform kindergartens`
    `health-profession teacher`

-- 5.1-5.4: the least position under the reform — a third for an existing
-- kindergarten teacher; a third for a new one unless the head of teaching
-- HR approved less; a fellow teacher enters the reform only when her
-- employment in reform kindergartens is a third or more (and only there);
-- a health-profession teacher may be employed below a third.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-1 akn:art_f__para_5-2 akn:art_f__para_5-3 akn:art_f__para_5-4
GIVEN k IS A `kind of teacher`, `position under the reform` IS A NUMBER, `below a third approved by the head of HR` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the part-time position is allowed` k `position under the reform` `below a third approved by the head of HR` IF
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `health-profession teacher` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `new kindergarten teacher` THEN `position under the reform` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 OR `below a third approved by the head of HR`
    OTHERWISE `position under the reform` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- 5.5: a part-time health-profession teacher's hours of each kind are in
-- proportion to the position; below a third, frontal hours only, and the
-- position is frontal hours over the base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-5 akn:art_f__para_5-5/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-5/p3
GIVEN `position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `a part-time health teacher's frontal, individual and stay hours` `position` IS
    IF `position` LESS THAN 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    THEN LIST (`position` TIMES `the health-profession week`), 0, 0
    ELSE LIST `health frontal hours` TIMES `position`, `health individual hours` TIMES `position`, `health stay hours` TIMES `position`

-- 5.6: work below a third under the reform does not count for the
-- required time (PZN) for promotion.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6
GIVEN `position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts for the required time` `position` IF
    `position` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- 6: where work above a full position is needed, all hours of every kind
-- together may not exceed 42 a week (the procedure for תשפ"ה at the link).
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p3 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p4 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p5
`the most weekly hours` MEANS 42

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `no more than 42 weekly hours` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    SHANT `employ above 42 weekly hours` h
          PROVIDED h GREATER THAN `the most weekly hours`
    WITHIN 365
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/2 §6: at most 42 weekly hours in all"

-- akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_7 The heading "7. the teaching mother".

§§ `7. עובדת הוראה אם`

-- 7.1: a mother of a child up to 14 employed at 79% or more in all her
-- positions (as the takanon says).
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-1
GIVEN `age of the youngest child` IS A NUMBER, `position in all her employment` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is entitled to a mother's position` `age of the youngest child` `position in all her employment` IF
    `age of the youngest child` AT MOST 14 AND `position in all her employment` AT LEAST 0.79

-- 7.2: a kindergarten-teacher mother may be absent a full day every two
-- weeks or half a day a week without loss of pay or position; one who, by
-- consent, is never absent all year has her position raised by 10%, above
-- 100% too.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-2 akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_a akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b/p2
GIVEN `position` IS A NUMBER, `never absent all year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a mother's position` `position` `never absent all year` IS
    IF `never absent all year` THEN `position` PLUS 0.1 ELSE `position`

GIVEN `fortnights in the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the mother's absence is allowed` `fortnights in the year` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `allow the mother's absence` d
          PROVIDED d AT MOST `fortnights in the year`
    WITHIN 365

-- 7.3: a health-profession mother or arts therapist works the reform's
-- ordinary week by the table at the link.
-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p2 akn:art_f__para_7-3/p3 akn:art_f__para_7-3/p4 The link to the work-week tables for a health-profession mother; the tables are outside the circular.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-3/p1
GIVEN `weekly hours by the linked table` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a health-profession mother's week` `weekly hours by the linked table` IS
    `weekly hours by the linked table`

-- 7.4: after maternity leave, a teacher at 90% or more takes one nursing
-- hour a day off her stay hours (five a week) for four months, without
-- loss; 7.2-7.3 do not apply meanwhile, and the two reductions are never
-- given together.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-4 akn:art_f__para_7-4/p2
GIVEN `position` IS A NUMBER, `months since maternity leave ended` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weekly nursing hours` `position` `months since maternity leave ended` IS
    IF `position` AT LEAST 0.9 AND `months since maternity leave ended` LESS THAN 4 THEN 5 ELSE 0

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_02-n: 7.4 takes the nursing hour "משעות השהייה";
-- 4.1.2 makes the kindergarten manager's and the fellow teacher's position
-- frontal hours only, and only the health-profession week of 4.2 has stay
-- hours. The reading adopted: for a kindergarten teacher the five hours
-- come off her weekly (frontal) hours, pay and position untouched.
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `stay hours in the week of` p IS 0

`a kindergarten teacher has no presence hours for the nursing hour` MEANS
        `stay hours in the week of` `kindergarten manager` EQUALS 0
    AND `stay hours in the week of` `fellow kindergarten teacher` EQUALS 0
    AND `weekly nursing hours` 1 1 EQUALS 5
    AND `health stay hours` EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `a kindergarten teacher has no presence hours for the nursing hour`

-- akn:art_f__para_7-4__subpara_8 The heading "8. age hours".

§§ `8. זכאות לשעות גיל`

-- 8.1: the age reduction is set at the start of the year by the teacher's
-- age on 31 December of that school year, for the whole year.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-1
GIVEN `age on 31 December of the school year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the age that counts` `age on 31 December of the school year` IS
    `age on 31 December of the school year`

-- 8.3-8.5: an existing teacher of 50-55 takes 2 frontal hours off her
-- base, one of 55 or over 4 (the table of 4.1.1 reads 50-55 as excluding
-- 55); a new teacher of 50 or over 2, and no more at 55; none lose position.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-3 akn:art_f__para_8-4 akn:art_f__para_8-5
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, `is existing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `age hours for a full position` age `is existing` IS
    BRANCH IF age AT LEAST 55 AND `is existing` THEN 4
           IF age AT LEAST 50 THEN 2
           OTHERWISE 0

-- 8.2: a part-time teacher of 50 or over gets a partial reduction "by the
-- rules detailed below and the reform's work week"; no rule below says how
-- it is computed (F-2024-25_tashpah_02-g). The share is an input.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-2
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, `is existing` IS A BOOLEAN, `share of the reduction for a part-time position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `age hours for a part-time position` age `is existing` `share of the reduction for a part-time position` IS
    `age hours for a full position` age `is existing` TIMES `share of the reduction for a part-time position`

`8.3-8.5 say how a part-time reduction is computed` MEANS FALSE

-- 8.6: the health professions' age rules are in the tables at the link.
-- akn:art_f__para_8-6/p2 akn:art_f__para_8-6/p3 The link to those tables; outside the circular.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6/p1
GIVEN `reduction by the linked tables` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a health teacher's age hours` `reduction by the linked tables` IS
    `reduction by the linked tables`

§§ `9. שעות פעילות גן`

-- 9.1-9.4: a teacher under the reform (any position) is paid for
-- kindergarten activity hours beyond position and salary, allotted by the
-- kindergarten's needs, at most 40 a school year (the split by half-years
-- is cancelled), for staff meetings, parents' and children's meetings and
-- after-hours events.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p2 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p3 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p4 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p5 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p6 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p7 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p8 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p9 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p10 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p11 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p12 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p13
`the most activity hours a year` MEANS 40

GIVEN `activity hours done` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `activity hours paid` `activity hours done` IS
    min `activity hours done` `the most activity hours a year`

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_10 The heading "10. teaching seniority".

§§ `10. ותק בהוראה`

-- 10.1-10.2: recognised seniority for the salary table is the takanon's,
-- without the internship and compulsory army service but with army or
-- national service in teaching; an existing teacher keeps every year
-- recognised for pay before moving to Ofek Hadash.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-1 akn:art_f__para_10-2
GIVEN `takanon teaching years` IS A NUMBER, `internship years` IS A NUMBER, `compulsory service years` IS A NUMBER, `years recognised before the move` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recognised seniority` `takanon teaching years` `internship years` `compulsory service years` `years recognised before the move` IS
    max (`takanon teaching years` MINUS `internship years` MINUS `compulsory service years`) `years recognised before the move`

§§ `11. קידום בדרגות`

-- 11.1: promotion needs the required time (PZN), professional development
-- hours (SHAPAM) by the Ministry's outline, and an evaluation (links).
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p2 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p3 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p4 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p5 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p6 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p7 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p8 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p9 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p10 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p11 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p12 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p13
DECLARE `promotion step` HAS
    `from grade`              IS A NUMBER
    `months required`         IS A NUMBER
    `development hours`       IS A NUMBER

GIVEN s IS A `promotion step`, months IS A NUMBER, hours IS A NUMBER, `evaluation passed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be promoted` s months hours `evaluation passed` IF
    months AT LEAST s's `months required` AND hours AT LEAST s's `development hours` AND `evaluation passed`

-- 11.2.1: certified academics, by the table.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p14 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p15 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p16 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p17 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p18 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p19 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p20 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p21 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p22 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p23 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p24 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p25 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p26
`the promotion table of certified academics` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` 1 30 120,
         `promotion step` 2 30 120,
         `promotion step` 3 36 180,
         `promotion step` 4 36 180,
         `promotion step` 5 36 180,
         `promotion step` 6 48 210,
         `promotion step` 7 48 210,
         `promotion step` 8 48 210

-- 11.2.2: uncertified academics. A veteran with "up to 25 years" who
-- joined as an exception cannot advance until certified; then the time
-- and hours count from joining for one promotion only, and up to 60 study
-- hours count as development hours. One with "25 years and more" need not
-- be certified. A new uncertified teacher starts counting at certification,
-- with no benefits. 25 years is in both (F-2024-25_tashpah_02-h).
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p27 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p28 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p29 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p30 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p31 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p32 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p33
GIVEN seniority IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF BOOLEAN
DECIDE `11.2.2's answers to "must certify before advancing"` seniority IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `must certify`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD seniority AT LEAST b's `seniority from` AND seniority AT MOST b's `seniority to`)
                (LIST `certification band` 0  25  TRUE,
                      `certification band` 25 999 FALSE))

DECLARE `certification band` HAS
    `seniority from` IS A NUMBER
    `seniority to`   IS A NUMBER
    `must certify`   IS A BOOLEAN

-- The reading adopted: 25 years needs no certification, as 3.2.1 ("below
-- 25") says.
GIVEN seniority IS A NUMBER, certified IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an uncertified academic may advance` seniority certified IF
    certified OR seniority AT LEAST 25

`study hours that may count as development hours` MEANS 60

-- 11.2.3: certified non-academics; 28 years or more need not complete a
-- degree, and advance by the table: 48 months and 480 hours a step.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p34 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p35 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/t1
`the promotion table of certified non-academics` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` 1 48 480,
         `promotion step` 2 48 480,
         `promotion step` 3 48 480,
         `promotion step` 4 48 480,
         `promotion step` 5 48 480,
         `promotion step` 6 48 480,
         `promotion step` 7 48 480,
         `promotion step` 8 48 480

§§ `12-15. גמולים`

-- 12-12.1: from 1.9.2023 a kindergarten manager's reward is the higher of
-- the rate of the combined salary in 138(א)(1) and 1,500.
-- F-2024-25_tashpah_02-o: the text does not say whether the 1,500 is paid
-- whole to a part-time manager. The reading adopted: it is a full
-- position's floor, paid in proportion to the position as the rate is.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_12 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_12/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-1 akn:art_f__para_12-1__subpara_12-1-1 akn:art_f__para_12-1__subpara_12-1-1/p2
GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER
      `full-position combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the kindergarten management reward` rate `full-position combined salary` `position` IS
    max (rate TIMES `full-position combined salary` TIMES `position`) (1500 TIMES `position`)

GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER
      `full-position combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the management reward with the floor paid whole` rate `full-position combined salary` `position` IS
    max (rate TIMES `full-position combined salary` TIMES `position`) 1500

`the floor read whole or pro-rated differs for a half-time manager` MEANS
        `the kindergarten management reward` 0.17 8000 0.5 EQUALS 750
    AND `the management reward with the floor paid whole` 0.17 8000 0.5 EQUALS 1500
#ASSERT `the floor read whole or pro-rated differs for a half-time manager`

-- akn:art_f__para_12-2/p1 A saving clause: the other rules of the management reward are unchanged.

-- 12.2's table of rates: a new manager by grade (1-2, 3-4, 5-9), an
-- existing one by management seniority (up to 5 inclusive, 6-10
-- inclusive, over 10). A new teacher starts at grade 1 (3.4.1) and is
-- promoted a whole grade at a time (11.2), so the table's whole-grade bands
-- cover her; the half grades of 16.5 come from converting EXISTING
-- teachers, whom the table rates by management seniority instead.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p7 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p8
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the rates the table gives a new manager at grade` grade IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band rate`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD grade AT LEAST b's `grade from` AND grade AT MOST b's `grade to`)
                (LIST `grade band` 1 2 0.17,
                      `grade band` 3 4 0.2,
                      `grade band` 5 9 0.21))

DECLARE `grade band` HAS
    `grade from` IS A NUMBER
    `grade to`   IS A NUMBER
    `band rate`  IS A NUMBER

GIVEN `management seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate of an existing manager` `management seniority` IS
    BRANCH IF `management seniority` GREATER THAN 10 THEN 0.21
           IF `management seniority` GREATER THAN 5 THEN 0.2
           OTHERWISE 0.17

-- The bands as one rule over whole grades 1 to 9.
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate of a new manager` grade IS
    BRANCH IF grade GREATER THAN 4 THEN 0.21
           IF grade GREATER THAN 2 THEN 0.2
           OTHERWISE 0.17

-- The table's note: a teacher who had a dragged management or counselling
-- reward before the appointment takes the higher of the two.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2/p9
GIVEN `management reward` IS A NUMBER, `dragged reward` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reward paid with a dragged reward` `management reward` `dragged reward` IS
    max `management reward` `dragged reward`

-- akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13 The heading "13. the fellow kindergarten teacher's supplement".

-- 13.1: the fellow teacher (the teacher in charge on the day the manager
-- does not work) is eligible if she receives none of the listed rewards
-- (management, education, dragged management or counselling, cluster
-- management, any salary protection).
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p7 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p8
GIVEN `in charge on a fixed day the manager is off` IS A BOOLEAN, `receives a listed reward` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an eligible fellow teacher` `in charge on a fixed day the manager is off` `receives a listed reward` IF
    `in charge on a fixed day the manager is off` AND NOT `receives a listed reward`

-- 13.2: from 1.9.2023, 10% of the combined salary, in proportion to a
-- part-time position, and as a full position's above 100%.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-2
GIVEN `full-position combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the fellow teacher's supplement` `full-position combined salary` `position` IS
    0.1 TIMES `full-position combined salary` TIMES min `position` 1

-- 13.3: counted for the hourly value, severance, substitution and school
-- activity hours, an hour's absence, 33(ד), the study fund and (accruing
-- pension) pension; not part of the combined salary nor in any base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-3
`the fellow teacher's supplement is in the combined salary` MEANS FALSE

-- 14: a cluster manager's reward by kindergartens (25% up to 6, 28% from
-- 7); a coordinating teacher in a cluster, an education reward of 10%
-- where she has no dragged management reward; a mentor, 2.4% per intern up
-- to three.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p4 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p7 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p8 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p9
GIVEN kindergartens IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cluster management rate` kindergartens IS
    IF kindergartens AT LEAST 7 THEN 0.28 ELSE 0.25

GIVEN `has a dragged management reward` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the coordinating teacher's education rate` `has a dragged management reward` IS
    IF `has a dragged management reward` THEN 0 ELSE 0.1

GIVEN interns IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor's rate` interns IS
    0.024 TIMES min interns 3

-- 15: from 1.9.2023 (agreement of 19.10.2022), for a teacher qualified in
-- special education: 9% → 10%, 14% → 15%, 17% in an autism or severe
-- mental-disorders kindergarten; for one not so qualified: 5.5%, and "in
-- special education" 8.5% (F-2024-25_tashpah_02-i).
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_1__cls_a akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_1__cls_b akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_1__cls_c akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_2__cls_a akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_2__cls_b
GIVEN `rate before` IS A NUMBER, `autism or severe mental disorders` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education rate of a qualified teacher` `rate before` `autism or severe mental disorders` IS
    BRANCH IF `rate before` EQUALS 0.14 AND `autism or severe mental disorders` THEN 0.17
           IF `rate before` EQUALS 0.14 THEN 0.15
           IF `rate before` EQUALS 0.09 THEN 0.1
           OTHERWISE `rate before`

GIVEN `teaches in special education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the rates 15 gives an unqualified teacher` `teaches in special education` IS
    IF `teaches in special education` THEN LIST 0.055, 0.085 ELSE LIST 0.055

-- The reading adopted: in special education (every teacher this circular
-- concerns) the 8.5% that names it.
GIVEN `teaches in special education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education rate of an unqualified teacher` `teaches in special education` IS
    IF `teaches in special education` THEN 0.085 ELSE 0.055

§§ `16-17. קביעת הדרגה ומקדמות`

-- 16: no grade without a file, a reported position and joining; the
-- Ministry alone sets it, from employment, education, seniority and the
-- salary of the conversion month — for an existing teacher, March of the
-- year before the move (seniority, education, training rewards, role,
-- stage), on the components that do not continue, at 100%; half grades are
-- possible; the links are to the salary tables and two circulars.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_16 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_16/p2 akn:art_f__para_16-1 akn:art_f__para_16-2 akn:art_f__para_16-3 akn:art_f__para_16-4 akn:art_f__para_16-5 akn:art_f__para_16-5/p2 akn:art_f__para_16-5/p3 akn:art_f__para_16-5/p4 akn:art_f__para_16-5/p5 akn:art_f__para_16-5/p6 akn:art_f__para_16-5/p7
GIVEN `file opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `position reported` IS A BOOLEAN, joined IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade can be set` `file opened` `position reported` joined IF
    `file opened` AND `position reported` AND joined

GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a grade the conversion may set` grade IF
    (grade TIMES 2) EQUALS FLOOR (grade TIMES 2)

-- akn:art_f__para_16-5__subpara_17 The heading "17. salary advances until the grade is set".

-- 17.1-17.2: until the grade is set, the owner pays joined teachers an
-- advance on top of current pay, computed on the listed components of
-- current pay, for the share of the position in the joined kindergarten
-- only, from joining ("Ofek Hadash advance"); when the grade is set, pay is
-- recomputed back to joining and all paid meanwhile, advance included, is
-- offset.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-1 akn:art_f__para_17-2 akn:art_f__para_17-2/p2
DECLARE `advance group` IS ONE OF
    `academic kindergarten teacher`
    `academic health-profession teacher`
    `intern`
    `non-academic veteran of 28 years`

-- 17.3: the rates.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p2 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p3 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p4 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p5 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p6
GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance rate` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `academic kindergarten teacher` THEN 0.16
    WHEN `academic health-profession teacher` THEN 0.14
    WHEN `intern` THEN 0.14
    WHEN `non-academic veteran of 28 years` THEN 0.1

GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`, `listed components of current pay` IS A NUMBER, `share in the joined kindergarten` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash advance` g `listed components of current pay` `share in the joined kindergarten` IS
    `the advance rate` g TIMES `listed components of current pay` TIMES `share in the joined kindergarten`

GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`, `listed components of current pay` IS A NUMBER, `share in the joined kindergarten` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owner pays the advance monthly` g `listed components of current pay` `share in the joined kindergarten` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `the Ofek Hadash advance` g `listed components of current pay` `share in the joined kindergarten`
    WITHIN 31

-- The circular's closing rule: it gathers the rules of the Ofek Hadash
-- agreements, and where it contradicts them, for or against the employee,
-- the agreements prevail.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3/p7
GIVEN `the agreements' answer` IS A NUMBER, `the circular's answer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `what applies` `the agreements' answer` `the circular's answer` IS
    `the agreements' answer`

-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p8 For information, the addresses in annex ו; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p9 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p10 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p11 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p12 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p13 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p14 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p15 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p16 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p17 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p18 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p19 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p20 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p21 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p22 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p23 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p24 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p25 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p26 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p27 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p28 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p29 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p30 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p31 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p32 The sign-off, signatures and the list of copies, which the corpus prints inside 17.3; no rule.

§§ `כתב ההתחייבות`

-- The commitment letter: by 30.8.2024 (day 26), or the institution cannot
-- join in תשפ"ה; the owner's signatory recites regulation 3(6) and
-- undertakes (1) to apply every Ofek Hadash rule for kindergartens from
-- תשפ"ה, (2) to give the Ministry the data it asks, (3) to pay the advance,
-- marking it on the payslip, sending each teacher the annex א letter and
-- having each sign annex ב, (4) to keep the signed commitments, (5) to have
-- an uncertified teacher who asks for Ofek Hadash commit to complete the
-- education (annex ג), (6) to send payslips when asked, (7) to pass on
-- requests not to join (annex ד); failing that, sanctions up to losing the
-- licence. Then the signature block.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3/p33 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p34 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p35 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p36 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p37 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p38 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p39 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p40 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_1 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_2 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_a akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_b akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_c akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_4 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_5 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_6 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p2
DECLARE `undertaking` HAS
    `applies Ofek Hadash from תשפ"ה`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `gives the Ministry the data`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `marks the advance on the payslip`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `sends each teacher the annex א letter`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `has each teacher sign annex ב`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `keeps the signed commitments`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the uncertified commit to complete`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `sends payslips when asked`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `passes on requests not to join`               IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN u IS AN `undertaking`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the owner is exposed to sanctions` u IF
    NOT (    u's `applies Ofek Hadash from תשפ"ה`
         AND u's `gives the Ministry the data`
         AND u's `marks the advance on the payslip`
         AND u's `sends each teacher the annex א letter`
         AND u's `has each teacher sign annex ב`
         AND u's `keeps the signed commitments`
         AND u's `has the uncertified commit to complete`
         AND u's `sends payslips when asked`
         AND u's `passes on requests not to join`)

-- akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p3 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p4 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p5 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p6 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p7 The signatory's confirmation and the signature block; no rule.

§§ `נספחים`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p6 akn:att_1__hc_1/p7 akn:att_1__hc_1/p8 akn:att_1__hc_1/p9 akn:att_1__hc_1/p10 akn:att_1__hc_1/p11 akn:att_1__hc_1/p12 akn:att_1__hc_1/p13 akn:att_1__hc_1/p14 akn:att_1__hc_1/p15 akn:att_1__hc_1/p16 akn:att_1__hc_1/p17 akn:att_1__hc_1/p18 akn:att_1__hc_1/p19 akn:att_1__hc_1/p20 akn:att_1__hc_1/p21 akn:att_1__hc_1/p22 Annex א, the model letter to the teacher: the advance is paid until the grade is set and then deducted in full, subject to the Wage Protection Law; it restates 17 and the undertaking's (3); kept by the owner.

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 akn:att_2__hc_1/p6 akn:att_2__hc_1/p7 akn:att_2__hc_1/p8 akn:att_2__hc_1/p9 akn:att_2__hc_1/p10 akn:att_2__hc_1/p11 akn:att_2__hc_1/p12 akn:att_2__hc_1/p13 akn:att_2__hc_1/p14 Annex ב, the teacher's model commitment that the advance will be deducted; a form restating 17.

-- Annex ג, the form to join exceptionally (academic without a teaching
-- certificate), and annex ד, the form asking not to join: each prints "the
-- last day to send the form to the Ministry is 30.8.2024", where 3.2.1 and
-- 3.6.5 set 31.12.2024 (F-2024-25_tashpah_02-a, -b). The rest of each is a
-- form: details, the meaning of "academic degree", declarations.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 akn:att_4__hc_1/p1
`the forms' last day` MEANS 26

